# Example shape only. The release workflow generates the real
# `SHA256SUMS` (and accompanying `SHA256SUMS.minisig`) by hashing
# every published platform binary, signing the manifest with the
# release minisign key, and writing both files into this directory
# before `npm publish`.
#
# Format: `<sha256 hex>  <basename>` per binary, two spaces between.

deadbeef0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000  mdk-recovery-darwin-arm64
deadbeef0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000  mdk-recovery-darwin-x64
deadbeef0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000  mdk-recovery-linux-arm64
deadbeef0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000  mdk-recovery-linux-x64
deadbeef0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000  mdk-recovery-win32-x64.exe
